(r)
"Terminal" means the place where the cargo and passengers change from one mode to other mode of transportation,
Terminal facilities include berthing, cargo transfer, storage and ticketing and passenger rest, comfort rooms; and
(s)
"Vessel" means every description of watercraft, including small craft, vessel under oars or sail, floating equipment and
non-displacement craft.
